<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Nov 22.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Nov 22.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ever Blessing 54,000-5% long tons heavy grain USG/Japan 5-10/12 $22.90 fio 11 days cnr.</p>
<p>TBN 33,000 long tons USG/Indonesia 6-18/12 $33.25 fio 5 days/1,500 Conti.</p>
<p>TBN 54,000-5% 2-11/12 NoPac/Japan $14.25 fio 11 days Conti.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
